    "source": "Performance",
    "tokens": [],
    "ja": "性能"
  },
  {
    "n": 84,
    "source": "Most C++ JSON libraries do not yet support JSON Schema. So we tried to evaluate the performance of RapidJSON's JSON Schema validator according to {1}, which tests 11 JavaScript libraries running on Node.js.",
    "tokens": [
      "<a href=\"https://github.com/ebdrup/json-schema-benchmark\">json-schema-benchmark</a>"
    ],
    "ja": "C++のJSONライブラリーの多くは、まだJSON Schemaに対応していません。そこで、Node.js上で動く11のJavaScriptライブラリーをテストする{1}に合わせて、RapidJSONのJSON Schemaバリデーターの性能を評価しました。"
  },
  {
    "n": 85,
    "source": "That benchmark runs validations on {1}, in which some test suites and tests are excluded. We made the same benchmarking procedure in {2}.",
    "tokens": [
      "<a href=\"https://github.com/json-schema/JSON-Schema-Test-Suite\">JSON Schema Test Suite</a>",
